  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I’m very happy that world preloading is officially supported right now (in beta still). Another idea comes to mind with preloading. If someone drops a portal and you don’t have that world preloaded, VRChat will start downloading that world. This option can be turned on or off in the  settings menu.\n\nEDIT: I got another good idea from someone related to this feature. To prevent random people from overriding your preload, making it friends only or having some portal priority system would stop the chance of someone else's portal overriding the one you intended on.",
